### Feature Users — escritura (sin auth hasta ISS-13)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 3

### Crear usuario (operario de planta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lavador.turno1",
  "full_name": "Carlos Pushaina",
  "email": "lavador1@textilclean.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Crear con username repetido → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "email": "otro@textilclean.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Reemplazar datos (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lavador.turno1",
  "full_name": "Carlos Andrés Pushaina",
  "email": "lavador1@textilclean.local",
  "avatar": null
}

### Modificar (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Carlos A. Pushaina"
}

### Cambiar contraseña
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "Password123!",
  "new_password": "Password456!"
}

### Desactivar (borrado lógico)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}/deactivate

### Eliminar (físico)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{id}}
